      "instruction": "Walk through each beat.",
      "beats": [
        {
          "id": "b1",
          "text": "Three overlapping deadlines land the same week. Appraisal: mostly threat, but one piece — renegotiating a due date — is controllable; a colleague's slow turnaround isn't."
        },
        {
          "id": "b2",
          "text": "One cyclic sigh before writing the renegotiation email — arousal was too high to write it well without it."
        },
        {
          "id": "b3",
          "text": "Problem-focused coping on the controllable piece: send the renegotiation email, specific and concrete."
        },
        {
          "id": "b4",
          "text": "Emotion-focused coping on the uncontrollable piece: accept the colleague's pace, and plan around it rather than pushing on something outside your control."
        }
      ]
    }
